flowchart TD
    A[📦 Manager Logs In] --> B[🏠 Dashboard<br>Sees: Inventory, Stock Alerts, Team Activity]
    
    B --> C{Choose Action}
    
    C -->|Check Inventory| D1[📋 View Product List]
    D1 --> D2{Stock Low?}
    D2 -->|Yes| D3[🟠 Low Stock Badge Appears]
    D3 --> D4[➕ Create Purchase Order (Vendor)]
    D4 --> D5[🔄 Update Stock Quantity]
    
    C -->|Track Team| E1[👥 View Employee List]
    E1 --> E2[📊 View Attendance / Performance]
    E2 --> E3[📝 Assign Task to Sales Rep]
    
    D2 -->|No| F[✅ Continue Operations]
    D5 --> F
    E3 --> F
    F --> G[🔚 End]
    
    note right of D4
        ✅ Can View Product Costs
        ❌ Cannot See Salaries
        ❌ Cannot Delete Invoices
        ❌ Cannot See P&L Reports
    end note
    
    style D3 fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#b71c1c
    style E2 fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17